  "description": "WOYFAT crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C66 H76 Cl2 Gd4 Mn2 N6 O22,3(C2 H3 N1),7(C1 H4 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 3 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.556-4.030 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.25-112.80°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [{LMn(Cl)(μ3-OH)Gd2(μ3-OH)(μ-Piv)2}2]·3MeCN·7MeOH·H2O (L = N′-(2-hydroxy-3-methoxybenzylidene)-2-(2-hydroxy-3-methoxybenzylideneamino)benzohydrazide trianion; Piv = pivalate). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
